    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Solomon Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guri iimu/ún tlehhtuwo baraá Yerusalemu, gawaá tloomár Moria didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tiwa dír Daudi geehhooeés. Diirí an afeenidár balaangw muxta ar Ornani heé Yebusi, tidá' Daudi aa tsawaár.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutno Solomon Do' nguwa iimu/ún tleehhamooro a bál slahhángw tsár tawa tsár oo kurkú tsiyáhh oo waawuti'iimarós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doó Mungú kudá' waawutmo Solomon aa tleéhh, tlenaangós a miíta mibeeri tsár nee faanqw, nee bihheero a miíta gwaleél. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afkú didár dahma tlenaangós a miíta gwaleél, adoodá' tlenángw bihhér do' i dirii'i, nee tlenángw gawa a miíta mibeeri kooán nee tsiyáhh. Guruú do'o, kutuwidár dír afkú do' kana na/aás ar sahaábuú hhohho'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matla/ángw doó Mungú kuna harweér ar peehhoó xa'anoodá' ta bay beroshi, kway ninkiriíts ar sahaábu hhohhó', slaqsoó slaansla nee oo minyororo kway gawaadá' i tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Solomon Doó Mungú gway parootuús ar tlaa/aá tlaxo uren, nee sahaábu amór yaamaá Parfaimu daáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós Doó Mungú sleémeero guna niinkiriíts ar sahaábu nee waqasuuwo nee nahhto nee koo/iro nee afér do' sleeme. Gawaá koo/iro slaqsa'aá keruúbi kiri tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám didá' ak ló'wa hhoohhoo' gana tleéhh, tlenaangós a miíta gwaleél, nee tlenángw bihheerós a miíta gwaleél sleeme, kari na/aás ar sahaábuú hhohhó' nee na/misuudá' gár aa faák a taáni mibeeri tsár nee kooán ar sahaábu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musumároó ira gadiyuús a graámu tsiire kooán nee mibeeraá faanqw oo sahaábu. Kuna koo/ír gáwtár tleéhh, nee sleeme koo/idá' kay niinkiriíts ar sahaábu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsa'aá tsár awa keruúbi giri tleéhh giri niinkiriíts ar sahaábu, kiri qaás didaádá' ak ló'wa hhoohhoo' baraá doó Munguhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhampe'eeraá keruúbidá' tlenaango a miíta tsiyáhh nee tlaqi dinkwaaro, hhampuú wák tlenaango a miíta tsár ga ba/abaa/, hhampuú wák koo/i gana kwatiít, hhampuú tsár nee oo keruúbír hatlá' tina doogiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhampa'aá keruúbidár hatlá' tlenaango aqo adór awa tidár geera, hhampuuwós koo/ír do' gana kwatiít, nee hhampuú tsár tay doogiyé' nee oo tidár geera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlenángw hhampe'eeraá tsár awa keruúbidá' a miíta tsiyáhh nee tlaqi. Inooín kiwa sihhtís kina alqoomeés, gur'er'ín kana amór matla/ángw xu'ús. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inqwaarír ta dó' ar qasiisi gay tleéhh ar kitaánír hhohho', ar kaloó sirboó/, nee oo sirdaa/aát, nee oo daa/aate. Gari qaalín ar slaqsa'aá keruúbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraá do'o uheemaá tsár awa muqslír sirdaa/aat gina tleéhh, umuú uhmoowo tlenaangós a miíta mibaá nee kooán nee tlaqi, nee umuúqo uhmoowo i slamángw kón oo tlenaangós a miíta tsár ga ba/abaá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himtuú taa qaalín gway tleéhh gawaá sagér uheemiidá', slaqsa'aá mamaá komamaánga gay gawaadá' i tleéhh awa tsiiruú wák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uheemiidá' kay sihhtís geeraá Doó Mungú, oo wák bihhaá dákw doó /iyáy, nee oo tsár doó basáy. Oo bihhaá doó /iyáy kway báy Yakini",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yakini:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gídaabárós a Mungú i gawdeemiis.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nee oo bihhaá doó basáy kway báy, Boasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Boasi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gídaabárós a ar /uuruú Mungú.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
